{"hw":"πλημμέλεια","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πλημμέλεια</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πλημμέλ-εια</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, prop. <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">mistake in music, false note,</b> but in usage, metaph., <b class=\"lex-tr\">fault, error,</b> esp. in taste or judgement, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">διὰ π. καὶ ἀμουσίαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">691a</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">faultiness</b> in metre, etc., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.396d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀσέβεια ἡ περὶ θεοὺς π.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">VV</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1251a31</span> </span> (hence in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">trespass, sin, Le.</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.5</span> </span>, al.; <span class=\"gk\">εἰς πλημμέλειαν</span> for a <b class=\"lex-tr\">sin</b>-offering, ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.18</span> </span>): freq. in pl., <span class=\"gk\">αἱ π. αἱ ἐν τοῖς πράγμασιν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.56</span> </span>, etc.</div></div>"}